{"title":"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine which of the two numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb5d744b1a6cc02c07bf337630f3b6278a45f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1}-\\sqrt{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458358c0028baa6ff79179db39b40850d702e613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c}-\\sqrt{c-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"19\" /> is greater for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f523c296ab1d6b46e95179fbdd48a78d6071b996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying and dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fb31d0f9a6c913599771889d3c2020ae149b7d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1}-\\sqrt c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"19\" /> by its conjugate,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5db5711353d0e523dd3bd6c2e0cedf4e002f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1}-\\sqrt c=\\frac{(\\sqrt{c+1})^2-(\\sqrt c)^2}{\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c}}=\\frac1{\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"402\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0c93da885359c9008dbbd9d25aa7c31097b8411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt c-\\sqrt{c-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt c+\\sqrt{c-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"226\" height=\"42\" />. We know that  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842a33dc616f6d0905d58afb3512fe24c9bc9278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac1{\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c}}&lt;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt c+\\sqrt{c-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"233\" height=\"44\" /> for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3861bae5894bfc7d9c0cc67dcf3dd3a396b7e4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1}-\\sqrt c &lt;\\sqrt c-\\sqrt{c-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"223\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Considering the derivative of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/744f60fca12aae17eb71dd0366953f314e754d6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\sqrt{x+1}-\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d2026b136dd03ba60c2981425b9bc04f56252ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f&#39;(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x+1}}-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"197\" height=\"43\" />. Putting under a common denominator, we can see that the top will be negative. \n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d96e2f7b9092a22f2f77a063a5be6912f6b98af2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\sqrt{c}-\\sqrt{c-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"113\" height=\"33\" /> is greater.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for both of the expressions, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b4012a4a6eaa4024e9da9f851db6a258c7fb04a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1} + \\sqrt{c} = \\sqrt{2} - \\sqrt{1} = \\sqrt{2} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d090389032b06d4e01b06d915af488c21de8333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c} - \\sqrt{c-1} = \\sqrt{1} - \\sqrt{0} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"230\" height=\"23\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50a99118a631a89a6b9516663955f061ff3470d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2} - 1 &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d5e158f7222b606da9482d64f8db6aba9381428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\sqrt{c} - \\sqrt{c-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"113\" height=\"33\" /> is greater\n-andliu766\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>subtracting the second expression from the first, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a58dd05551affa2fa02168d8ab1f5ac8c9e362.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c}-(\\sqrt{c}-\\sqrt{c-1})=\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c}-\\sqrt{c}+\\sqrt{c-1}=\\sqrt{c+1}+\\sqrt{c-1}&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"671\" height=\"23\" /> Therefore, the first expression is larger.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the derivative of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba6133cf3e9c6d0a14d7e5e86194a8087cc5d9f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"19\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a18b1f49c5b0f6372e6cd786498f95d060831f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"31\" height=\"43\" />. This is a decreasing function, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21104d381f59da0f7fc5be0b6ed83d461038b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x}-\\sqrt{x-a} &gt; \\sqrt{x+a}-\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"21\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25634d7212302efdeb3702974863759bfb74d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />. Plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> to get the required inequality.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO\">1969 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017084157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1021/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4695/500